color circle in Brainfuck

Every input byte is one setInterval tick  the program moves the
arcs and prints that frame as SVG  zero or end of input stops

Positions stay below 360 as q tens and o ones of a degree
SVG rotate turns each half ring by its position and the viewBox
scales rLast to half the canvas like size did

tape  a header of 44 cells then one record of 44 cells per arc
header  stop tick then tmp flag k rLast pen helper then rLast
and 2 rLast as text  digit space  first width padding arcAmount
record  marker count i k n q o tmp flag speed width padding r1
pen helper then position r1 r2 and color as text  digit space

var arcAmount  first  width  padding
>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>>++++++++++>+++++>++>++++
++++

rLast is first plus width and padding times arcAmount minus 1
plus width  kept as text for the viewBox with twice its value
